OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AUK also affected by cyber-attack which
OL,4,Ahit European supermarket fridges
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter hackers targeted refrigeration
OL,7,Fsystems in supermarkets and food
OL,8,Fsuppliers across Europe, the National
OL,9,FCyber Security Centre (NCSC) says it is
OL,10,Faware of "a couple of instances where
OL,11,Fvulnerable technology had been
OL,12,Fexploited in the UK".
OL,14,FThe NCSC's chief executive Dr Richard
OL,15,FHorne told the Today programme, on BBC
OL,16,FRadio Four, that it had "worked through
OL,17,Fthe night" to alert potentially
OL,18,Faffected organisations in the UK.
OL,20,FHe said it had alerted "handfuls" of
OL,21,Fbodies, and that it was aware of a
OL,22,F"couple of impacts".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
