OL,3,AUK also affected by cyber-attack which
OL,4,Ahit European supermarket fridges
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after supermarkets in
OL,7,Fcountries including Ireland, Sweden,
OL,8,FEstonia, and Belgium reported fridges
OL,9,Fbeing hiked in temperature on Monday.
